---
description: Stormpeak ocean module (modules/stormpeak)
globs: modules/stormpeak/**
alwaysApply: false
---

`modules/stormpeak` is an isolated ES-module ocean theatre. Do not add it to
`boot.js` or `assets/data/manifest.json`. Production sea sim remains `src/sea.js`.

Gerstner constants must stay in sync GPU/CPU. Y = `48 * tanh(y/48)`. Ping = P.
